{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19092","headline":"送义舟师却还黔南 · 刘禹锡","name":"送义舟师却还黔南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黔江秋水浸云霓，独泛慈航路不迷。\n猨狖窥斋林叶动，蛟龙闻咒浪花低。\n如莲半偈心常悟，问菊新诗手自携。\n常说摩围似灵鹫，却将山屐上丹梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}